                  I was sold before I even walked into Victor's office. He hired me on the spot.
                </p>
                <p>
                  I had no money for the return flight. My sister lived in Los Angeles.
                  I took a bus. My roommate at Duke, Prarthana Hegde, packed my suitcase and mailed
